5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about relying on external schedules. We need stability.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Where we sit dictates who can reach us. Geography is key.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Why do we ignore what already worked here? Old records matter.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect our current funding model is structurally fragile.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
