35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The roads closed, but the halls stayed open. That is resilience.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The bus cuts mean an hour's trip for outer ward residents.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,The old outreach sheets show forty visitors a session. That was real.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The grant covers sessions, not the vehicles. The equipment money vanished.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The volunteers are skilled, but no staff member is trained to supervise them.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, so the money is there, but the logistics are not?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, yes. The physical barrier is the real cost.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Minako, if we use the old outreach model, we need supervision.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, the equipment line was a one-off. The running line is recurring.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, exactly. We have the people, but not the management structure.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,We need a plan that does not depend on the roads.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,A remote option might bypass the bus cuts entirely.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,The digitisation project failed because nobody indexed the images. We must avoid that.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"If we choose a service with high recurring costs, we will be broke in year two.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,We must pick a service where the skills are already on the roster.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I am leaning towards something that can be done from home.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. Distance is the enemy.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,I want to see if the old outreach can be revived properly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will vote for the option with the lowest recurring cost.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,I will vote for the option that matches our current staff skills.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
